'''Medivaemia roots''' can be found on one of the sides of [[Vespula]]'s lair during the [[Chambers of Xeric]]. Players can pick a flowered root to obtain a [[medivaemia blossom]], used to feed the [[lux grub]]s so that their health does not reach zero.

